    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;padding: 0cm 5.4pt; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The proposal is therefore not lawful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has not been demonstrated that the proposed use of the&amp;nbsp;single storey outbuilding in the rear garden would be incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse as such, the proposal would therefore not be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E, E.4 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
